"This class functions as an SCTableViewModel section that is able to represent an array"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"of any kind of items and automatically generate its cells from these items. The section"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also able to handle all end-user interaction with the generated cells, including adding,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing, deleting, and moving the cells. When cells are added or edited, detail views are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"automatically generated for this purpose. To enable adding cells, the class’ user should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set the addButtonItem property of the section to a valid UIBarButtonItem, the section then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will automatically add new items when the button is tapped."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"SCArrayOfItemsSection","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SCArrayOfItemsSection"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build data-driven UIKit table interfaces with Sensible TableView."}],"title":"STV","url":"\/documentation\/stv","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCArrayOfItemsSection/addCellForNewItem:":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"addCellForNewItem:"}],"title":"addCellForNewItem:","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection\/addcellfornewitem:","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection\/addCellForNewItem:","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Subclasses should override this method to handle adding a cell for newItem (method called internally by framework)","type":"text"}]}}}